[h2]Nutrient recovery and optional wet-reject collection[/h2]
Optional Agriculture 0.9.0 integration reuses the original Residue Collector with finite capacity, exclusive pairing and its existing mount requirements. Framework 0.22.0 and Shipbreaker 0.20.0 support measured wet-reject capture from [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3757331189]Valtora’s Ship’s Water 0.16.1[/url]. Full or unavailable linked collectors hold wastewater in its source tank. No wastewater-to-fertilizer recipe is claimed. [url=https://github.com/phobos-dthorga/phobos-ostranauts/blob/main/docs/agriculture-nutrient-production.md]Operating guide, economic limits and research attribution[/url].
